📊 Model Performance

On the current train/test split, the Random Forest model achieved:

Accuracy: 99.68%

The model performed particularly well on several classes such as:

BENIGN
DDoS
DoS Hulk
PortScan
FTP-Patator
DoS GoldenEye

However, some attack categories contain very few training examples.

For example:

Infiltration has very few samples.
Web Attack - Sql Injection has very few samples.
Several other attack categories are highly imbalanced.

Therefore, the reported 99.68% accuracy is specific to the current dataset and train/test split.

It should not be interpreted as a guarantee of real-world cybersecurity detection performance.

